Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.94,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KEEP OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.92,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,{\pos(606.666667,260)}EPISODE 4\NKICKING TURBO GRANNY'S ASS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.94,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:14.07,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I believe it's ladies first, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:15.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But see, I'm so teary-eyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They're bone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's only fair to go side-by-side!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:25.08,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Okarun, you're behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:28.25,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Argh, that's not fair, Miss Ayase!\NNow you're behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:30.21,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Damn you!\N- Wait! Hold on, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.30,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Let's go.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:38.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So what were we going to do again\Nwhen Turbo Granny shows up? Punch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:42.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No! We're luring her outside of Shono City\Nto separate her from the location-bound spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.93,0:00:46.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That way, she'll weaken,\Nand even we can defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:48.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:53.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But we defeated that giant alien already,\Nso maybe we can defeat her, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:54.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were scared just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, she's a granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:00.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,After experiencing something\Nthat huge, a granny...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.91,0:01:03.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:05.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wh-What should we do, Miss Ayase!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Calm down!\NYou just mentioned it just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:08.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're leaving Shono City, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:09.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:15.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! Is this legit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:17.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:19.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I should be able to do it. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:28.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Her eyes are mouth! So gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:30.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, please unleash the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.31,0:01:31.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll make something out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:34.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Got it! Counting on you!\N- Okay! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, no good. I don't think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am utterly useless...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:45.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right,\Nyou become a total downer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:48.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll cheer for you, so go do your best!\NFight on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:51.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be crushed to death\Nfrom that pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:54.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:56.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:58.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why? I can't see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:00.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The power of the curse is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:02.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I returned his weenie to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The curse is no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:10.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to use\Nthe power of the curse to transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:12.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I won't let you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:15.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You thieving pig!\NI won't let you use my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:21.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm going to thoroughly chew\Nand eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:23.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Taunt her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:26.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}That thing has absolute confidence\Nin its running.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}A few random taunts\Nand it's sure to take the challenge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:31.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you that scared of losing\Nin a race?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:35.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Such brute force is so unfashionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I mean, your name is Turbo Granny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:40.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way you'd pass a race\Nto show off how fast you can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:42.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're really Turbo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,then challenge us with how fast you can run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:53.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who do you think\Nyou're mouthing off to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd lose in a running match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.74,0:03:03.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll accept your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.49,0:03:06.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Besides, I can eat you two at any point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:09.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are the rules?\NWhere's the finish line?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:12.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No finish line. We're playing tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:15.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you catch us, you win.\NSimple, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:17.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Count for ten minutes when you begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:19.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll make a run for it\Nin the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:22.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Those are the rules, so you absolutely\Nhave to adhere to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:26.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you don't, the legend of Turbo Granny\Nwill just be a piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:31.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I hate people who break the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:33.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then, let's begin! Run, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:41.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:40.15,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Amazing! I totally thought\Nwe were goners!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:41.57,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, are you a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:44.37,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I know! But I shoulda provoked a bit harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.74,0:03:49.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One minute, three minutes,\Nfive minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.28,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ten minutes might be cutting it close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:53.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Eight minutes, six minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:53.21,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on! She's counting weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:03:59.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okaru...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:04.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:08.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Her ten minutes have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now I have to count your ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:14.48,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Forty...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:17.27,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One minute... Two minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.69,0:04:18.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's cheating!\NRelease Miss Ayase at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:22.86,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Fifty-six... Fifty-seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:21.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop! That way of counting is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You said you were going\Nto adhere to the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:25.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She didn't specify how to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Four minutes... Five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gimme a break! Stop counting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:31.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:40.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you're kinda dense, Okarun.\NI'll probably be helping you next time, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:44.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me suckle that teat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.76,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How dare you suckle my teat\Nwithout permission!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go, you bastard! Brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one who said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:59.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I absolutely won't let go\Nuntil you release Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:00.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:03.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?\NI can't muster my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it because of this outfit!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you! I have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll possess you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:20.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a hassle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:28.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You aren't connected\Nto some sorcerer, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:33.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh well. I'll eat the girl and end it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this feeling\Nof being crushed inside a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can tell. Even if I can't see,\NI can tell really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:47.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Granny's main form slipped in,\Nso it's crystal clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.57,0:05:49.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,by sense of touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:55.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Blast you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You saved me, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's my line.\NThat was awesome, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:14.14,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it! Let me outta this brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:18.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I caught you, you scummy hag!\NHow should we torture you now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give Granny back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:28.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Location-bound spirit, kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why is the location-bound spirit a crab!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:19.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma said the dead turn themselves\Ninto freshwater crabs to cross the River Styx!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:22.98,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,BEWARE OF BEARS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:27.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This way! Over here!\NWhere are you looking, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:28.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, time to transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn granny! You stay still, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:33.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- How dare you address me as such?\N- Miss Ayase, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:37.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's really hard! Unlike before,\Nyou have the real thing in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That was close! This is super serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.63,0:08:50.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Curse you! Don't use my power\Nwithout permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:51.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go, you punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:54.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is great!\NIt's easier to squish you directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:56.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, it's lookin' bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't get chummy\Nand call me by my first name!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:00.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're too heavy\Nso I can't make this curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For real!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:07.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Time to go full throttle now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.11,0:09:15.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wicked! It's like a helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:16.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.87,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.17,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm all droopy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.71,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry. Seriously, you're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:31.92,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I already used one full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:34.38,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's right, you can only go\Nfull throttle twice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:36.13,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I think we gained some distance, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:37.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:44.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a ton of faces on its back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap! There's a lot of people here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that?\NHe's totally giving a piggyback ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What dedication. So hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is totally embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! Nobody else can see the crab!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.11,0:09:56.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:10:00.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That means we just look like\Nwe're all in on a chicken fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:02.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I hope I don't bump into any friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, my stamina\Nis getting seriously low.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, try harder!\NWhat about your other full throttle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:09.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No good even if I go full throttle.\NI can't leave Shono City distance-wise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,At this rate, that thing\Nwill catch up and eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:12.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously, anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I ain't letting no crab eat me!\NI would rather eat a crab instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:20.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's try something. Hang a right, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:25.43,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,HEALTH LAND
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome. How many will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:32.02,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,MANGA CAFE\NA TIME TO RELAX
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:29.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Head upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:31.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It should be harder for it\Nto chase us in a narrow place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter at all!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,An explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:40.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hot! What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:46.91,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is not good, Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.54,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crabs thrive in waterfronts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:51.38,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Water is water, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:54.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,this is a hot spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:04.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When you boil crabs, the meat\Ntightens up and gets plump, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:07.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tightening up means that\Nthe muscle fibers stiffen up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.47,0:11:09.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,so maybe its movements will slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:20.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It stopped. It stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:21.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that it's all red,\Nit totally looks yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Freaky! You were looking at it like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop eyeing it,\Nand let's just get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:33.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Straight down this road\Nand we'll escape Shono City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't there fewer people than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:50.81,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap, crap, crap, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What are those guys!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Idiots! You won't get away that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:59.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's a giant cemetery\Nat the edge of Shono City!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:02.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I just borrowed some help\Nfrom the spirits already resting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:06.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,After all, Shono City is our territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:14.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:20.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're not letting you leave Shono City!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, go full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.47,0:12:32.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Is it all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:35.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if I use it here,\Nwe won't make it to the next city!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:39.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you don't use it, we'll die right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Man, I'm so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:53.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,One more full throttle from this kid\Nand he'll be immobile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:57.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.11,0:13:26.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan, I can't make this turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:45.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan! We gotta get back\Nto the original route!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:23.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You untransformed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:23.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:29.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't suddenly let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:42.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, land!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm done for. I'm at my limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My body is going to rip apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:05.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Too wicked! I thought\NI was gonna puke out my organs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.13,0:15:09.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's only a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:13.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:16.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Crap, I let go of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:25.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't forgive you for this.\NYou keep cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What I detest the most...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:31.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,is your lack of respect for elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:34.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You really are an amazing senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:37.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never seen an old person\Nwho can bully young folks this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Mad respect for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Speak properly, you punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can see through your ploys\Nto use modern words to fool the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:49.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I really hate those words. I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:52.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I hate shady brats like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, I'll eat ya, so run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:08.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can leave Shono City real soon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:13.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll wait for you to finish running.\NTen minutes? Or 20 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:17.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then I'll take one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:21.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My ability is to take anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:35.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Turbo Granny used to be called\NHundred Kilo Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:40.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The Takasaki Line's maximum speed\Nis 120 kmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,She can't catch up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so slow! What a slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:48.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're nothing compared to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:57.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:01.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Trains aren't always going at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:03.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They slow down at curves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:08.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But I can always run at 100 kmph.\NI'm not letting you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:11.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"I'm not letting you get away,"\Nis my line, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:15.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Just like Grandma said,\Nyou always take the bait if I taunt ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're already on board...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,the rails of your defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.31,0:17:27.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. Welcome to Kamigoe City.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You rotten bastard pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:31.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You were really fast, senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:36.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's like you haven't lived\Na long time for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:38.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nobody can win against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But in this race...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:43.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.48,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, where are we!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.04,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's the crab? And Turbo Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:30.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks like we defeated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:39.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I really didn't want to be rough like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:46.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This is where girls around your age were violated,\Ncut to pieces, and tossed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:51.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They didn't become evil spirits\Nbecause they wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:59.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We spirit mediums\Nhave long hunted Turbo Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:06.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Granny always showed up in places\Nwhere spirits of girls met irrational deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:11.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps she went around consoling the spirits\Nof the girls who couldn't rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.29,0:19:16.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But the dead shouldn't assault the living.\NThat's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.46,0:19:19.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We have to use force\Nto send them to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:25.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,The same goes for the living.\NThey should never do anything to mock the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:30.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Trample into their territory disrespectfully,\Nand you can only blame yourself for your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:36.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Those are the rules for the living\Nand the dead to coexist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:42.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm glad you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it, old hag!\NDon't take all the big ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:53.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you don't give me this piece of crab,\NI'll break your Bakatono DVDs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.21,0:19:57.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Try me! You do that and I'll burn\Nall your Ken Takakura merch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:59.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're taking Mr. Ken as hostage!?\NYou really aren't human!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:02.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one\Nwho took Bakatono hostage first!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- What'd you say, hag!?\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:06.10,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um, I don't have an appetite,\Nso if you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:09.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You have crab right in front of you\Nbut no appetite? What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:10.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:12.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd totally be eating\Nunder normal circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:14.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How can you eat crab right after\Nexperiencing what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:19.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Then what do you want to eat\Nat what kind of time, you entitled brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:21.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:25.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so whiny for a guy.\NAre you sure you have something down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.03,0:20:28.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I do! Thank you for retrieving it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:30.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.12,0:20:32.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to show me\Nthat it's actually there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:34.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:36.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.47,0:20:43.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you insane!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, do something about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This family is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold up, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:57.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's late so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:02.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I think it'll be safer than this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not getting away next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:05.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm never showing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:08.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:14.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Leave her be. She's not serious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:18.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You weren't eating crab and were pretty depressed,\Nso I think she tried to cheer you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:23.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that's it. I'm sorry I made her\Nbe so considerate...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:24.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.59,0:21:27.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well then, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.47,0:21:28.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodbye...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:42.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:44.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.16,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.82,0:21:49.53,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:51.79,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.83,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:03.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:10.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.61,0:23:44.52,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Grandma, why was it a crab?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:48.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They say spirits of the dead turn themselves\Ninto freshwater crabs to cross the River Styx!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.65,0:23:50.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why they turned into location-bound\Nspirits inside that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.78,0:23:52.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But yeah, I'm surprised\Nyou really ate all that crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:54.62,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 5\NLIKE, WHERE ARE YOU BALLS?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:54.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"Like, Where Are Your Balls!?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.78,0:23:56.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why I told you to show me.
